  planner_response {
    response: "I have upgraded the AI model and updated the application\'s configuration and UI to support **Nano Banana 2** (Gemini 3.1 Flash Image).\n\n### Key Changes:\n1.  **Model Upgrade**: The \"Pro\" generation model has been upgraded from Gemini 3 Pro to **Nano Banana 2** (`gemini-3.1-flash-image-preview`).\n2.  **UI & Translations**:\n    *   Updated sidebar labels and tooltips to reflect the change to **Nano Banana 2**.\n    *   Updated both English and Traditional Chinese translations.\n    *   Updated the initial canvas welcome note to mention the upgrade to Nano Banana 2.\n3.  **Technical Improvements**:\n    *   Added a `lint` script to `package.json` for easier code validation.\n    *   Added global type declarations for `window.aistudio` in `types.ts` to resolve TypeScript errors.\n    *   Verified the build and linting to ensure application stability.\n\n### How to use:\n*   In the sidebar under **Model Priority**, you can now select **Nano Banana 2** for high-quality image generation.\n*   When **Nano Banana 2** is selected, you can choose between **1K, 2K, and 4K** image sizes.\n*   Note: Using Nano Banana 2 requires a paid API key, which you will be prompted to select if not already configured.\n\nThe application is now fully updated and ready for high-quality image creation with the latest model."
